<title>USA: NYSE seat sold for $1,175,000.</title>
<headline>NYSE seat sold for $1,175,000.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that a seat on the exchange sold for $1,175,000, down $25,000 from the last seat sale on May 16.</p>
<p>The NYSE said the current bid for a seat is $1,145,000, and the offer is $1.5 million.</p>
</text>
